{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14694","headline":"张评事涉秦居士系见访郡斋即同赋中字 · 戴叔伦","name":"张评事涉秦居士系见访郡斋即同赋中字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轺车忽枉辙，郡府自生风。\n遣吏山禽在，开罇野客同。\n古墙抽腊笋，乔木扬春鸿。\n能赋传幽思，清言尽至公。\n城欹残照入，池曲大江通。\n此地人来少，相欢一醉中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}